                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you're old like me, you remember Asteroids. I also remember being terrible at it, wanting to get better, but not having the endless quarters it would take to do so.\n\nThis game was made for you - not only prettier, more dynamic, and with better sound & music, but with a gentler learning curve. That said, it's hard. Seems deceptively simple at first, but play the tutorial to dig deeper at what this game has to offer. \n\nIf you want classic arcade action with indie passion and just good ol' nostalgic fun, this is a steal!",
